[
 {
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 0.0
 },
 {
  "text": "In March twenty twenty, the United States launched a campaign with a very specific name.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 3.468,
  "chunk": 0,
  "pause_after": 0.343
 },
 {
  "text": "Fifteen Days to Slow the Spread.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 3.812,
  "end": 4.959,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Work from home if you can.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 4.959,
  "end": 6.106,
  "chunk": 1,
  "pause_after": 0.318
 },
 {
  "text": "Skip gatherings of ten or more.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 6.423,
  "end": 7.687,
  "chunk": 2,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "Fifteen days, and it would be over.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 7.899,
  "end": 9.359,
  "chunk": 3,
  "pause_after": 0.208
 },
 {
  "text": "Within two weeks, it was extended to forty-five.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 9.567,
  "end": 11.941,
  "chunk": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "Now imagine it never ended.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 11.941,
  "end": 13.425,
  "chunk": 4,
  "pause_after": 1.167
 },
 {
  "text": "Not the virus.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 14.592,
  "end": 15.284,
  "chunk": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "The emergency.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 15.284,
  "end": 15.745,
  "chunk": 5,
  "pause_after": 0.293
 },
 {
  "text": "The rules, the empty offices, the screens.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 16.038,
  "end": 17.429,
  "chunk": 6
 },
 {
  "text": "All of it, staying on.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 17.429,
  "end": 18.422,
  "chunk": 6,
  "pause_after": 0.227
 },
 {
  "text": "What would the world look like today?",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 18.649,
  "end": 19.822,
  "chunk": 7,
  "pause_after": 0.625
 },
 {
  "text": "Let's find out.",
  "section": "THE FIFTEEN DAYS",
  "start": 20.448,
  "end": 21.187,
  "chunk": 8,
  "pause_after": 0.758
 },
 {
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 21.945
 },
 {
  "text": "First, an important difference.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 21.945,
  "end": 23.216,
  "chunk": 9,
  "pause_after": 0.596
 },
 {
  "text": "This isn't about a virus that stays as deadly as it was.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 23.812,
  "end": 26.435,
  "chunk": 10,
  "pause_after": 0.389
 },
 {
  "text": "It's about an emergency that never switches off.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 26.824,
  "end": 29.158,
  "chunk": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "People still learn.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 29.158,
  "end": 30.034,
  "chunk": 11,
  "pause_after": 0.232
 },
 {
  "text": "People still adapt.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 30.265,
  "end": 30.948,
  "chunk": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "But nobody ever says, \"It's over.\"",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 30.948,
  "end": 32.314,
  "chunk": 12,
  "pause_after": 0.268
 },
 {
  "text": "And to be fair, an emergency isn't declared lightly.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 32.582,
  "end": 34.479,
  "chunk": 13,
  "pause_after": 0.24
 },
 {
  "text": "The World Health Organization estimates the pandemic was linked to about fifteen million deaths in twenty twenty and twenty twenty-one, counting those it caused indirectly.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 34.718,
  "end": 41.018,
  "chunk": 14,
  "pause_after": 0.341
 },
 {
  "text": "The official count of deaths from Covid itself was about five and a half million.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 41.359,
  "end": 44.328,
  "chunk": 15,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "That is why the world took it so seriously.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 44.648,
  "end": 46.33,
  "chunk": 16,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "The harder question is how long a world can live like that.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 46.543,
  "end": 49.181,
  "chunk": 17,
  "pause_after": 0.974
 },
 {
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 50.155
 },
 {
  "text": "Melbourne gives us a clue.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 50.155,
  "end": 51.197,
  "chunk": 18,
  "pause_after": 0.269
 },
 {
  "text": "Across six separate lockdowns, the city spent two hundred and sixty-two days under restrictions.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 51.466,
  "end": 55.06,
  "chunk": 19,
  "pause_after": 0.3
 },
 {
  "text": "At the time, that was the most of any city in the world.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 55.359,
  "end": 57.237,
  "chunk": 20,
  "pause_after": 0.375
 },
 {
  "text": "Shops shut.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 57.612,
  "end": 58.108,
  "chunk": 21
 },
 {
  "text": "Streets emptied.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 58.108,
  "end": 58.604,
  "chunk": 21
 },
 {
  "text": "Neighbours became faces on a screen.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 58.604,
  "end": 60.093,
  "chunk": 21,
  "pause_after": 0.254
 },
 {
  "text": "When it finally lifted in October twenty twenty-one, people celebrated.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 60.346,
  "end": 63.061,
  "chunk": 22,
  "pause_after": 0.681
 },
 {
  "text": "But that was months, with an end in sight.",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 63.742,
  "end": 65.237,
  "chunk": 23,
  "pause_after": 0.36
 },
 {
  "text": "What happens when there's no end in sight?",
  "section": "A CITY THAT TRIED",
  "start": 65.597,
  "end": 67.17,
  "chunk": 24,
  "pause_after": 0.854
 },
 {
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 68.024
 },
 {
  "text": "Some places went much longer.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 68.024,
  "end": 69.299,
  "chunk": 25,
  "pause_after": 0.292
 },
 {
  "text": "China locked down Wuhan in January twenty twenty, and kept strict versions of those rules for almost three years.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 69.591,
  "end": 74.24,
  "chunk": 26,
  "pause_after": 0.233
 },
 {
  "text": "In spring twenty twenty-two, Shanghai locked down twenty-five million people for about two months.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 74.473,
  "end": 78.402,
  "chunk": 27,
  "pause_after": 0.209
 },
 {
  "text": "Then, in December twenty twenty-two, the rules were dropped.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 78.611,
  "end": 80.762,
  "chunk": 28,
  "pause_after": 0.368
 },
 {
  "text": "Reports linked the change to protests and to a more contagious variant.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 81.131,
  "end": 83.899,
  "chunk": 29,
  "pause_after": 0.393
 },
 {
  "text": "Three years is a long time for a world on pause.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 84.291,
  "end": 86.431,
  "chunk": 30,
  "pause_after": 0.353
 },
 {
  "text": "It shows two things.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 86.784,
  "end": 87.808,
  "chunk": 31,
  "pause_after": 0.524
 },
 {
  "text": "An emergency can last far longer than anyone plans.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 88.332,
  "end": 90.866,
  "chunk": 32,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "And ending one may be harder than starting one.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 91.25,
  "end": 92.867,
  "chunk": 33,
  "pause_after": 0.304
 },
 {
  "text": "Either way, the first thing to change would be work.",
  "section": "THE COUNTRY THAT STAYED CLOSED",
  "start": 93.171,
  "end": 94.791,
  "chunk": 34,
  "pause_after": 1.032
 },
 {
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 95.824
 },
 {
  "text": "Before the pandemic, only about five to seven percent of paid workdays in the United States were done from home.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 95.824,
  "end": 99.811,
  "chunk": 35,
  "pause_after": 0.342
 },
 {
  "text": "Then, almost overnight, kitchens became offices.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 100.154,
  "end": 102.039,
  "chunk": 36,
  "pause_after": 0.381
 },
 {
  "text": "Today, even with the emergency long over, about one paid workday in four is still done at home.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 102.42,
  "end": 106.359,
  "chunk": 37,
  "pause_after": 0.285
 },
 {
  "text": "So in a world where the emergency never ended, that number wouldn't stay a quarter.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 106.644,
  "end": 110.473,
  "chunk": 38,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "It could become most of it.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 110.678,
  "end": 111.653,
  "chunk": 39,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "Cities built around commuting would have to become something else.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 111.89,
  "end": 114.394,
  "chunk": 40
 },
 {
  "text": "Rush hour, gone.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 114.394,
  "end": 115.145,
  "chunk": 40,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "Lunch spots downtown, empty.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 115.358,
  "end": 116.572,
  "chunk": 41,
  "pause_after": 0.443
 },
 {
  "text": "Some people would save hours every day.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 117.015,
  "end": 118.333,
  "chunk": 42,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "Others would never meet their colleagues in person.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 118.619,
  "end": 120.087,
  "chunk": 43,
  "pause_after": 0.218
 },
 {
  "text": "It's freedom and loneliness in the same package.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 120.304,
  "end": 122.32,
  "chunk": 44,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "And it wasn't only adults who stayed home.",
  "section": "THE END OF THE COMMUTE",
  "start": 122.641,
  "end": 124.374,
  "chunk": 45,
  "pause_after": 0.888
 },
 {
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 125.262
 },
 {
  "text": "When schools closed, children moved to screens.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 125.262,
  "end": 127.133,
  "chunk": 46,
  "pause_after": 0.261
 },
 {
  "text": "In the United States, the twenty twenty-two Nation's Report Card showed the biggest drop in maths scores ever recorded.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 127.395,
  "end": 131.685,
  "chunk": 47,
  "pause_after": 0.279
 },
 {
  "text": "Eighth graders lost eight points.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 131.964,
  "end": 133.034,
  "chunk": 48,
  "pause_after": 0.411
 },
 {
  "text": "By the usual rule of thumb, that's close to a year of learning.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 133.445,
  "end": 135.448,
  "chunk": 49,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "Researchers warn that closures weren't the only cause.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 135.687,
  "end": 137.668,
  "chunk": 50,
  "pause_after": 0.608
 },
 {
  "text": "But the pattern was hard to miss.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 138.277,
  "end": 139.489,
  "chunk": 51,
  "pause_after": 0.33
 },
 {
  "text": "In a world with no end, a whole generation grows up learning through a window.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 139.819,
  "end": 143.513,
  "chunk": 52,
  "pause_after": 0.201
 },
 {
  "text": "Some children thrive that way.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 143.714,
  "end": 144.856,
  "chunk": 53
 },
 {
  "text": "Many don't.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 144.856,
  "end": 145.313,
  "chunk": 53,
  "pause_after": 0.281
 },
 {
  "text": "And what about the people who weren't sick with Covid at all?",
  "section": "THE EMPTY CLASSROOM",
  "start": 145.594,
  "end": 147.965,
  "chunk": 54,
  "pause_after": 1.063
 },
 {
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 149.028
 },
 {
  "text": "Hospitals filled up with one disease, and everything else had to wait.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 149.028,
  "end": 151.446,
  "chunk": 55,
  "pause_after": 0.313
 },
 {
  "text": "Early in the pandemic, researchers estimated that tens of millions of operations around the world were cancelled or postponed in just twelve weeks.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 151.76,
  "end": 157.445,
  "chunk": 56,
  "pause_after": 0.349
 },
 {
  "text": "Check-ups were skipped.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 157.794,
  "end": 158.532,
  "chunk": 57
 },
 {
  "text": "Screenings were missed.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 158.532,
  "end": 159.269,
  "chunk": 57,
  "pause_after": 0.398
 },
 {
  "text": "Many people stayed away from hospitals out of fear.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 159.667,
  "end": 162.505,
  "chunk": 58
 },
 {
  "text": "Postponed care doesn't disappear.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 162.505,
  "end": 163.766,
  "chunk": 58,
  "pause_after": 0.392
 },
 {
  "text": "It builds up like a queue.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 164.158,
  "end": 165.174,
  "chunk": 59,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "In a world with no end, the queue only grows.",
  "section": "THE QUEUE FOR CARE",
  "start": 165.461,
  "end": 167.38,
  "chunk": 60,
  "pause_after": 0.708
 },
 {
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 168.088
 },
 {
  "text": "But care found a workaround.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 168.088,
  "end": 169.065,
  "chunk": 61,
  "pause_after": 0.214
 },
 {
  "text": "In February twenty twenty, about one in a thousand primary-care visits for Medicare patients happened by video or phone.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 169.279,
  "end": 173.97,
  "chunk": 62,
  "pause_after": 0.246
 },
 {
  "text": "By April, it was more than four in ten.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 174.216,
  "end": 175.658,
  "chunk": 63,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "Across the whole of twenty twenty, Medicare telehealth visits rose about sixty-three times over.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 175.933,
  "end": 179.916,
  "chunk": 64,
  "pause_after": 0.2
 },
 {
  "text": "A patient in a remote village could see a specialist without a four-hour drive.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 180.116,
  "end": 183.687,
  "chunk": 65,
  "pause_after": 0.222
 },
 {
  "text": "A busy parent could talk to a doctor from the sofa.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 183.909,
  "end": 186.101,
  "chunk": 66,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "In a world with no end, that becomes the new normal.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 186.307,
  "end": 188.275,
  "chunk": 67,
  "pause_after": 0.335
 },
 {
  "text": "In the real world, some of it stayed.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 188.61,
  "end": 189.949,
  "chunk": 68
 },
 {
  "text": "Which brings us to the sky.",
  "section": "THE DOCTOR ON THE SCREEN",
  "start": 189.949,
  "end": 190.953,
  "chunk": 68,
  "pause_after": 0.917
 },
 {
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 191.87
 },
 {
  "text": "In twenty twenty, the number of air passengers fell by about sixty percent, according to the United Nations' aviation agency.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 191.87,
  "end": 196.769,
  "chunk": 69,
  "pause_after": 0.28
 },
 {
  "text": "Planes sat parked.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 197.049,
  "end": 197.794,
  "chunk": 70
 },
 {
  "text": "Borders closed.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 197.794,
  "end": 198.291,
  "chunk": 70,
  "pause_after": 0.387
 },
 {
  "text": "Weddings, funerals and reunions moved to screens.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 198.678,
  "end": 200.655,
  "chunk": 71,
  "pause_after": 0.303
 },
 {
  "text": "In April twenty twenty, the International Monetary Fund projected that the world economy would shrink by about three percent that year, the worst since the Great Depression.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 200.958,
  "end": 207.778,
  "chunk": 72,
  "pause_after": 0.219
 },
 {
  "text": "A short emergency is survivable for businesses that depend on people moving.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 207.997,
  "end": 211.81,
  "chunk": 73,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "A permanent one is not.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 212.085,
  "end": 213.534,
  "chunk": 74
 },
 {
  "text": "Airlines.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 213.534,
  "end": 213.824,
  "chunk": 74
 },
 {
  "text": "Restaurants.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 213.824,
  "end": 214.113,
  "chunk": 74,
  "pause_after": 0.382
 },
 {
  "text": "Small shops.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 214.496,
  "end": 215.044,
  "chunk": 75
 },
 {
  "text": "Tourist towns.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 215.044,
  "end": 215.593,
  "chunk": 75,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "All of them would need to become different businesses.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 215.798,
  "end": 217.53,
  "chunk": 76,
  "pause_after": 0.682
 },
 {
  "text": "But the biggest cost may be one you can't see on a balance sheet.",
  "section": "THE EMPTY SKY",
  "start": 218.212,
  "end": 220.397,
  "chunk": 77,
  "pause_after": 0.805
 },
 {
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 221.201
 },
 {
  "text": "In its first year, the pandemic raised anxiety and depression worldwide by about twenty-five percent, according to the World Health Organization.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 221.201,
  "end": 226.821,
  "chunk": 78,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "Young people and women were hit hardest.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 227.137,
  "end": 229.177,
  "chunk": 79
 },
 {
  "text": "Humans are social animals.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 229.177,
  "end": 230.344,
  "chunk": 79,
  "pause_after": 0.39
 },
 {
  "text": "Remove the handshake, the shared table and the crowded room, and something wears down.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 230.733,
  "end": 234.417,
  "chunk": 80,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "Yet some people found things they hadn't expected.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 234.674,
  "end": 236.909,
  "chunk": 81
 },
 {
  "text": "Time with family.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 236.909,
  "end": 237.748,
  "chunk": 81,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "Quiet.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 237.984,
  "end": 238.245,
  "chunk": 82
 },
 {
  "text": "Flexibility.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 238.245,
  "end": 238.506,
  "chunk": 82
 },
 {
  "text": "Both are true.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 238.506,
  "end": 239.289,
  "chunk": 82,
  "pause_after": 0.317
 },
 {
  "text": "That's what makes this so hard.",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 239.607,
  "end": 240.556,
  "chunk": 83,
  "pause_after": 0.273
 },
 {
  "text": "So how did the real world get out?",
  "section": "THE QUIET COST",
  "start": 240.829,
  "end": 242.197,
  "chunk": 84,
  "pause_after": 1.148
 },
 {
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 243.345
 },
 {
  "text": "Faster than almost anyone expected.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 243.345,
  "end": 244.624,
  "chunk": 85,
  "pause_after": 0.388
 },
 {
  "text": "The virus's genetic code was published in January twenty twenty.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 245.011,
  "end": 248.255,
  "chunk": 86,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "On the second of December that year, less than eleven months later, the first vaccine was authorised, in the United Kingdom.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 248.635,
  "end": 253.028,
  "chunk": 87,
  "pause_after": 0.25
 },
 {
  "text": "Then came more vaccines, new treatments, and, slowly, immunity built up from vaccination and from infection.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 253.278,
  "end": 258.344,
  "chunk": 88,
  "pause_after": 0.278
 },
 {
  "text": "In May twenty twenty-three, the World Health Organization declared the global emergency over.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 258.622,
  "end": 262.373,
  "chunk": 89,
  "pause_after": 0.557
 },
 {
  "text": "But listen carefully to what it said.",
  "section": "THE WAY OUT",
  "start": 262.93,
  "end": 264.111,
  "chunk": 90,
  "pause_after": 0.821
 },
 {
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 264.932
 },
 {
  "text": "The emergency ended.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 264.932,
  "end": 265.664,
  "chunk": 91
 },
 {
  "text": "The virus didn't.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 265.664,
  "end": 266.396,
  "chunk": 91,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "The World Health Organization stressed that Covid-nineteen was still a global health threat, still circulating, still changing.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 266.806,
  "end": 271.807,
  "chunk": 92,
  "pause_after": 0.406
 },
 {
  "text": "It simply no longer needed emergency mode.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 272.214,
  "end": 274.166,
  "chunk": 93,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "So in a way, Covid never ended.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 274.576,
  "end": 276.036,
  "chunk": 94,
  "pause_after": 0.249
 },
 {
  "text": "We just stopped treating it as an emergency.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 276.285,
  "end": 278.36,
  "chunk": 95
 },
 {
  "text": "Some things never went back, either.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 278.36,
  "end": 279.917,
  "chunk": 95,
  "pause_after": 0.243
 },
 {
  "text": "About one paid workday in four is still done at home.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 280.16,
  "end": 282.0,
  "chunk": 96,
  "pause_after": 0.337
 },
 {
  "text": "Schools learned to teach online.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 282.338,
  "end": 283.342,
  "chunk": 97,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "The question isn't whether we can live alongside it.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 283.727,
  "end": 285.522,
  "chunk": 98
 },
 {
  "text": "We already do.",
  "section": "THE REAL TWIST",
  "start": 285.522,
  "end": 286.12,
  "chunk": 98,
  "pause_after": 1.021
 },
 {
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 287.141
 },
 {
  "text": "So what if the emergency had never ended?",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 287.141,
  "end": 288.845,
  "chunk": 99,
  "pause_after": 0.517
 },
 {
  "text": "Offices would be museums.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 289.362,
  "end": 290.562,
  "chunk": 100
 },
 {
  "text": "Classrooms would be windows.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 290.562,
  "end": 291.761,
  "chunk": 100,
  "pause_after": 0.4
 },
 {
  "text": "Hospital queues would be longer, and the sky would be quieter.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 292.161,
  "end": 294.785,
  "chunk": 101,
  "pause_after": 0.738
 },
 {
  "text": "But the real world landed somewhere in between.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 295.523,
  "end": 297.515,
  "chunk": 102,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would say we kept the best parts: flexibility, science that moves fast, and an alarm that can be switched on.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 297.755,
  "end": 302.125,
  "chunk": 103,
  "pause_after": 0.273
 },
 {
  "text": "And we let go of the rest.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 302.398,
  "end": 303.29,
  "chunk": 104,
  "pause_after": 0.414
 },
 {
  "text": "In March twenty twenty, we were asked to stay home for fifteen days.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 303.704,
  "end": 306.381,
  "chunk": 105,
  "pause_after": 0.288
 },
 {
  "text": "The emergency ended.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 306.669,
  "end": 307.619,
  "chunk": 106,
  "pause_after": 1.331
 },
 {
  "text": "Which parts of it would you keep?",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 308.95,
  "end": 310.163,
  "chunk": 107,
  "pause_after": 2.0
 }
]